SUMMARY:Stamp Your Way Around BCCLS
DESCRIPTION:Summer Fun for Everyone\n\nExplore the 78 BCCLS Member 
 Libraries in search of hidden treasures!\n\nJoin the 2026 BCCLS Scavenger 
 Hunt - a fun-filled journey to discover the BCCLS logo hidden in 
 participating libraries.\n\n \n\nHere’s how it works:\n\n\n	\n	Pick up 
 your scavenger hunt form at the Tenafly Library starting June 
 15.\n	\n	\n	Visit at least 3 libraries between June 15 and August 15\, 
 2026\, and find the hidden BCCLS logo.\n	\n	\n	Get your form stamped with 
 each library’s property stamp as proof of your discovery!\n	\n	\n	Return 
 your form to any BCCLS library by August 29\, 2026.\n	\n\n\nVisit at least 
 3 libraries (2 in addition to the Tenafly Library) and you may win a $50 
 Visa Gift Card.\n\n\n	\n	One for an adult (18 ) and one for a child.\n	\n
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Adult Reading Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10286-16983163
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16983163
END:VEVENT
