SUMMARY:Plan a Profitable Yard Sale - Jamie Novak
DESCRIPTION:Log on during your lunch break to learn what to do first when 
 thinking about a sale and what items are hot sellers!\n\nFollow expert 
 organizer Jamie Novak's steps to host an easy sale. Learn insider secrets 
 for staging\, pricing\, and what to do with the leftovers. Just in time for 
 prepping for the Glen Ridge Town Wide Yard Sale on Saturday\, September 
 26th! \n\nVirtual Program | Registration Required\nOpen to all
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
UID:LibCal-10286-16318664
