SUMMARY:Library Chef: Beath the Heat - No/Low Cook Soon to Be Food Fav's
DESCRIPTION:Stay cool while building kitchen skills this summer! Learn how 
 to create fresh Caprese Stuffed Avocado and DIY Summer Rolls using simple 
 techniques and fresh ingredients. Practice essential knife skills\, 
 ingredient prep\, and discover how to make flavorful\, healthy meals with 
 little to no cooking.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Class
