SUMMARY:Library Chef Teen: Turkey & Provolone Sloppy Joes w/ Coleslaw
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate National Sandwich Month!\n\nJoin us for a fun\, 
 hands-on cooking session designed especially for pre-teens and teens (ages 
 10 and up)! Learn how to make hearty Turkey & Provolone Sloppy Joes paired 
 with fresh\, crunchy coleslaw that's perfect for lunch or dinner. Along the 
 way\, you'll build real kitchen skills\, gain confidence in the kitchen\, 
 and enjoy cooking alongside other young chefs from home.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Class
