SUMMARY:Roll For It Club - Grades 4-6
DESCRIPTION:Curious about tabletop roleplaying games like Dungeons & 
 Dragons? Ever wanted to play pretend with your friends and create epic 
 adventures through storytelling and rolling dice? We'd like to welcome you 
 to our new club\, Roll For It! We hope that you join us for our first 
 adventure\, Castle High: A Daggerheart Game! Players will experience the 
 tabletop roleplaying game Daggerheart\, build friendships\, create cool 
 characters\, battle creatures\, go on adventures on an island in the sky\, 
 and search for missing classmates all while attending magical classes! 
 \n\nSign ups are limited\, so sign up today - We can't wait for you to 
 join!\n\nGrades 4-6 | Registration Required*\n*Glen Ridge patrons 
 ONLY\n\nCampaign Dates: 10/15\, 10/ 29\, 11/12\, 12/3 & 12/17\n
