SUMMARY:How to Prepare Your Home for Sale: A Strategic Approach to Maximizing Value in Glen Ridge and Northern NJ
DESCRIPTION:Looking to move but don't know where to begin? Want proven 
 strategies that will help your house stand out in this competitive market? 
 Join Clare Morcella of Morcella Homes for an informative session on 
 preparing your home to achieve its highest market value. Drawing on a 
 decade of Northern New Jersey real estate expertise\, Clare will share 
 proven strategies for showcasing your home's strengths\, attracting 
 qualified buyers\, and maximizing your return.\n\nBio: Clare Morcella is a 
 Platinum Circle of Excellence Award Recipient and is ranked in the top 1% 
 of real estate agents nationwide. With a decade of local market 
 experience\, Clare brings trusted expertise\, strategic insight\, and a 
 proven record of results.\n\nAdult Program | Registration Required\nOPEN to 
 all
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
